{"ordinal":13105,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453038219271","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_Gun_0e4fbd3","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13106,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453038219270","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_Gun_05ebfd2","source":"Edgar: Знаешь, когда долго лежишь рядом с кем-то… начинаешь перенимать его черты. Мне кажется, я стал её частью.","target":"Edgar: Știi, când zaci mult timp lângă cineva… începi să preiei trăsăturile acelei persoane. Cred că am devenit o parte din ea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13107,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453038219269","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Eyes_Gun_08c5be6","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13108,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453038219268","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Eyes_Gun_0cbe833","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13109,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453038219267","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Eyes_Gun_0dca5b5","source":"Edgar: Дай мне уйти самостоятельно. Прибереги патроны…","target":"Edgar: Lasă-mă să plec singur. Păstrează-ți gloanțele…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
