{"ordinal":13113,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453034024969","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Teeth_Gun_075d764","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13114,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453034024968","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Teeth_Gun_0edfa9f","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13115,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453034024967","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Teeth_Gun_017f818","source":"Edgar: Ты хочешь, чтобы я испугался? Нет, друг. Это всего лишь оболочка. Она и так уже разваливается.","target":"Edgar: Vrei să mă sperii? Nu, prietene. E doar un înveliș. Oricum se destramă deja.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13116,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453034024966","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Ears_05d9990","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
