{"ordinal":13123,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453029830665","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Photo_02b1f90","source":"Edgar: Или, точнее… что ты там увидел?","target":"Edgar: Sau, mai bine zis… ce ai văzut acolo?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
