{"ordinal":13127,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453029830661","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_0510951","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13128,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453029830660","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_0da73af","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13129,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453029830659","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_0ab0060","source":"Edgar: Тело не любит, когда его держат в одном положении слишком долго. А у меня выбора не было.","target":"Edgar: Trupului nu-i place să fie ținut prea mult într-o singură poziție. Iar eu n-am avut de ales.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13130,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453029830658","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_0b84b4a","source":"Edgar: Но это оказалось бессмысленным.","target":"Edgar: Dar s-a dovedit zadarnic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13131,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453029830657","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Armpit_0a49c9c","source":"Edgar: Тело не любит, когда его держат в одном положении слишком долго. Сначала я берёг себя для неё.","target":"Edgar: Trupului nu-i place să fie ținut prea mult într-o singură poziție. La început aveam grijă de mine pentru ea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
