{"ordinal":13134,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453025636360","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Eyes_00b1b7a","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13135,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453025636359","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Eyes_06b1a03","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13136,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453025636358","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Edgar_Eyes_0ac090c","source":"Edgar: Но по привычке ищу её силуэт взглядом. Хотя бы периферийным надеюсь что-то заметить.","target":"Edgar: Dar, din obișnuință, îi caut silueta cu privirea. Sper să zăresc ceva măcar cu coada ochiului.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-330.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
